 data collaboration solution as a personal data center, storing and managing data for creators and small organizations. A distributed collaborative computing network can be formed by personal servers located around the world. It could also control and connect all smart devices, providing cross-ecosystem local intelligent services.","Furthermore, the personal cloud could combine personal data to train personalized AI assistants. The idea is that this technology would be an effective way to solve the issue of consumer data asset ownership and , as well as provide a more affordable and efficient computing solution for individuals and small organizations."],"features":["The cost of computing power and storage was decreasing fast.","A part of cloud computing was moving towards edge computing.","The issue of consumer data asset ownership and attribution had been ignored.","Friendly UI designed for home scenarios","No code, no forms, intuitive, design for humanity"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/IceWhaleTech/CasaOS/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"0627ea809c98d6a918bf76e5ec058ff9ff129db8c352b5b9c861fa059a1a48ad","extractedAt":"2026-10-03T05:59:56.031Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T09:09:48.357Z","overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-09-28T10:37:14Z","demoHealth":{"url":"http://demo.casaos.io/","attemptedAt":"2026-10-05T14:56:37.580Z","status":"working","nextCheckAt":"2026-10-12T14:56:37.580Z","consecutiveTemporaryFailures":0,"probeVersion":2,"checkedAt":"2026-10-05T14:56:37.580Z","lastWorkingAt":"2026-10-05T14:56:37.580Z","target":"http://demo.casaos.io/#/login","failureCount":0},"previewAttemptAt":"2026-10-05T14:56:37.580Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"In 2020, the team noticed three important trends:","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/IceWhaleTech/CasaOS/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[{"text":"Friendly UI designed for home scenarios","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/IceWhaleTech/CasaOS/blob/main/README.md"}],"requirements":[{"kind":"paid_service","